# Normalize line endings for everyone, regardless of OS or local git
# config (core.autocrlf). Without this, Windows checkouts show every
# text file as "modified" on a fresh clone/pull even when the content
# is byte-identical — only the line endings differ.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit for clarity; these are all plain text and should stay LF.
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary-ish or license/text files that don't need line-ending rewriting.
LICENSE text eol=lf